!#Reaction Mechanism
!!#Title: An experimental and modeling study on norbornane pyrolysis aided by chemical information from neural network-assisted molecular dynamics
!!#Authors: Hang Xiao, Zhaohan Chu, Haodong Chen, Taichang Zhang, Jinghui Lu, Changyang Wang, Long Zhao, and Bin Yang.
!!#Address: Center for Combustion Energy and Department of Energy and Power Engineering, Tsinghua University, Beijing 100084, China.
ELEMENTS
C    H    N    O    AR    HE    Kr
END
SPECIES
!-------------------- C0 species ----------------------------------------------------------------------
H			H2			H2O    		N2    		AR    		HE    		Kr
